  "app_id": 332570,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "The original open-world, ragdoll sandbox physics extravaganza! Grand Frog Auto, Swindon (with farting ragdoll frogs) Use bonkers physics to throw ridiculous, farting ragdoll frogs all around town and beyond the city walls. Its a living world full of wonder Its a Big Big world out there, with lots to discover, but you don't have to do it alone! Work together to unlock things faster! 1-4 players Local split-screen co-op Couch Co-op for days Play co-op or combat or just do your own thing - its up to you! Film each other doing crazy stunts Don’t forget to use a vacuum for faster bulk collection! Different items unlock different prizes and costumes at different locations Collect everything from berries, apples, oranges, acorns, zombie flesh, jam jars, ammo, bombs, money, skulls, fish or dead pigeons, live pigeons, live penguins, cockroaches, crabs, jelly fish, dried crispy flies, rabbits, bats, rubber ducks, trophies, cats, sweets... Collect EVERYTHING! too many items to list! You never know what might come in handy. There are lots of ways to earn cash around Swindon Shire Work in Gardening, Rubbish Collection, Crazy Taxi Missions, Ice Cream Vendor, Vermin Exterminator , Or Kill the RICH! and take their money. Earn your cash how you choose! Look out for other Jobs around Swindon. If it fits, it can flush! Try Flushing everything to discover the transformative effects of the Magical Mystery Toilet. Repeat flushes can intensify the magic ( just like in real life )."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The original open-world, ragdoll sandbox physics extravaganza!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/b03ada9d265a317e13c3ea2893781758.poster.avif?t=1794929790\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/b03ada9d265a317e13c3ea2893781758.webm?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/b03ada9d265a317e13c3ea2893781758.mp4?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grand Frog Auto, <strong>Swindon</strong> (with farting ragdoll frogs)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a7122b67ad90c4ef376ca9c8f7ceb10f.poster.avif?t=1794929790\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a7122b67ad90c4ef376ca9c8f7ceb10f.webm?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/a7122b67ad90c4ef376ca9c8f7ceb10f.mp4?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use bonkers physics to throw ridiculous, farting ragdoll frogs all around town and beyond the city walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/5892dc9410fc5914a361864cd8e85784.webp?t=1794929790\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/854bd62670c1e5fa472822dfafe33b55.poster.avif?t=1794929790\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/854bd62670c1e5fa472822dfafe33b55.webm?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/854bd62670c1e5fa472822dfafe33b55.mp4?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Its a living world full of wonder </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/68f381d63f01158cf37de9bdf4389881.poster.avif?t=1794929790\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/68f381d63f01158cf37de9bdf4389881.webm?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/68f381d63f01158cf37de9bdf4389881.mp4?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Its a <strong>Big Big world</strong> out there, with lots to discover, but you don't have to do it alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/627ac9eec4f75d551dad7e8290dfa9a7.webp?t=1794929790\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/5cb181e2ad839e2b0a6e297e1005ad10.poster.avif?t=1794929790\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/5cb181e2ad839e2b0a6e297e1005ad10.webm?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/5cb181e2ad839e2b0a6e297e1005ad10.mp4?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work together to unlock things faster!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/7ac1c92acf7c29fe4288dbceb130e171.poster.avif?t=1794929790\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/7ac1c92acf7c29fe4288dbceb130e171.webm?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/7ac1c92acf7c29fe4288dbceb130e171.mp4?t=1794929790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>1-4 players</strong>  Local split-screen co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Couch Co-op</strong> for days</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play co-op or combat or just do your own thing - its up to you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/95cf0bdd52083688a62c3be1ad1849c8.poster.avif?t=1794929790\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/95cf0bdd52083688a62c3be1ad1849c8.web